cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  agent-evidence-vectors: conformance vectors for agent execution evidence
message: >-
  This is software. It implements and tests the adversarial-execution-evidence
  predicate; the normative artifact is that predicate's own text, which is
  settled upstream in the in-toto attestation project and vendored here under
  spec/predicates/ with the commit it was taken from recorded in
  spec/VENDOR-PIN.json. It carries no standing as a standard or a specification
  of its own. Cite the specification for what the predicate requires and this
  suite for what a corpus forces. If this
  suite is used to demonstrate conformance, or a claim is made about what it
  does or does not exercise, cite the released version rather than the branch. A
  conformance claim against a moving target is not a conformance claim.
type: software
authors:
